<title>SRI LANKA: Sampath falls on profit-taking.</title>
<headline>Sampath falls on profit-taking.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Sampath Bank Ltd fell 1.79 percent, or 1.25 rupees, to 68.75 in early Friday trade as retailers booked profits, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Sampath is a retail favourite because it is low in price, has growth potential and is liquid,&quot; said a local broker. &quot;They (retailers) are taking profit in the share, since it has gained over five percent in the last week&quot;.</p>
<p>Sampath Bank is one of four private commercial banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>---Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
